1
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,351
What if the canvas was the prompt?

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:12,362
Circle the block. That gesture becomes exact context.

3
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:20,034
Now the agent reads the live page, not pixels,
and draws every force where the question lives.

4
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:22,959
It solves. It moves.

5
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:35,908
Then one human mark rejects friction.
Every dependent answer changes.
Four point zero six becomes four point nine one.

6
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:41,194
Same gesture. Harder question.

7
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:49,329
One arrow says an assassination caused a world war.
That is too simple.

8
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:57,911
TRACE expands the missing decisions
and brings two sources into the same surface.

9
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:08,191
Cross out mobilization. The path bends.
War remains possible, not fixed.

10
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:17,564
Fourteen Site tools. Discovered by the page.
Called live inside ChatGPT.

11
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:25,721
One artifact. Two interfaces.
Visible authorship. Reversible actions.

12
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:27,802
The canvas is the prompt.
